# Pricing notes	B

# - Cache values are stored per vendor.	I

# - We only reconcile once per hour.	I

# - Discounts are ignored if the seller is unknown.	I

# - Shipping fees are tracked separately.	I

# - Price drops smaller than 1% are ignored.	I

# - Coupons are applied after tax rules.	I

# - Manual overrides require operator approval.	I

# - Scrapes during maintenance windows are skipped.	I

flag_one	I
=	I
True	I

# Inventory notes	I

# - Backorders are tracked separately.	I

# - Warehouse holds are recorded in tickets.	I

# - Inventory locks expire after 15 minutes.	I

# - Vendor blocks are kept for 30 days.	I

# - Sync retries happen every 5 minutes.	I

# - Stock overrides require supervisor approval.	I

flag_two	I
=	I
True	I

# Alert notes	I

# - Pagers are used for critical alerts.	I

# - SMS is used when email bounces.	I

# - Night shifts have separate rotations.	I

# - Alerts are suppressed during outages.	I

# - Escalations happen after 3 attempts.	I

# - Suppression windows expire at midnight.	I

flag_three	I
=	I
True	I

# Audit notes	I

# - Price edits are logged with operator IDs.	I

# - Audit trails are archived monthly.	I

# - Anomaly checks run daily.	I

# - Fraud checks are scheduled weekly.	I

# - Chargebacks are reviewed quarterly.	I

# - Policy changes require two approvals.	I

flag_four	I
=	I
True	I

# Compliance notes	I

# - Retention rules differ by region.	I

# - GDPR exports run on request.	I

# - HIPAA rules apply to health vendors.	I

# - PCI scans run after release.	I

# - Tokens are rotated every 90 days.	I

# - External audits happen annually.	I

flag_five	I
=	I
True	I

# Operations notes	I

# - Rollbacks are manual during outages.	I

# - Maintenance windows are scheduled.	I

# - Vendor rates change without notice.	I

# - Contract renewals are quarterly.	I

# - Canary deploys take 2 hours.	I

# - Hotfixes require approvals.	I

flag_six	I
=	I
True	I

# Support notes	I

# - On-call rotations are monthly.	I

# - Escalation docs are in the handbook.	I

# - Vendor bridges are recorded.	I

# - Major incidents require postmortems.	I

# - Incident reviews happen weekly.	I

# - Pager overrides expire in 24 hours.	I

flag_seven	I
=	I
True	I

# Metrics notes	I

# - Latency percentiles are stored hourly.	I

# - Error rates are sampled per region.	I

# - Throughput is averaged by vendor.	I

# - Backoff rates are recorded.	I

# - Retry storms are throttled.	I

# - Cache hit ratios are persisted.	I

flag_eight	I
=	I
True	I

